%% CURRENT — the capture pipeline as implemented across phone and backend (near-exactly-once delivery).
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as User
  participant P as Phone · recording + ASR
  participant Q as Phone · capture job queue (Room)
  participant B as FastAPI backend
  participant L as LLM providers
  U->>P: Tap KK Capture, speak, tap again
  P->>P: Create the client capture ID (never regenerated)
  P->>P: Transcribe on device, delete audio only once the receipt is durable
  P->>Q: Enqueue the capture job
  Q->>B: POST /v1/capture (transcript + client capture ID)
  alt Seen before: same account and capture ID
    B-->>Q: Replay the cached response
  else New capture
    B->>L: Judge TODO / THOUGHT / IGNORED, research a THOUGHT
    L-->>B: Result
    B->>B: Meter the call, cache the response (no content)
    B-->>Q: Result
  end
  Q->>P: Save the todo or thought under a stable local ID
  Note over Q,B: Retries are stage-aware and honor 429 Retry-After with backoff
